 *     `from`, and gate the animation on [data-deck-active] and the motion
 *     query, e.g.:
 *       .fade-up { opacity: 1 }
 *       @media (prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){ [data-deck-active] .fade-up{ animation: fadeUp .5s both } }
